[32m+[m[32m# Security Policy[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFocalDesk is alpha compositor and desktop environment software. Security-sensitive[m
[32m+[m[32mbehavior may include process launching, IPC, permissions, portals, input handling,[m
[32m+[m[32mdisplay output, file access, and automation features.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Supported Versions[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSecurity fixes are handled on the current default branch. FocalDesk does not[m
[32m+[m[32mcurrently maintain separate supported release branches.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Reporting a Vulnerability[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPlease do not report security vulnerabilities in public issues, discussions, or[m
[32m+[m[32mpull requests.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIf GitHub private vulnerability reporting is enabled for this repository, use[m
[32m+[m[32mthat channel. Otherwise, contact a maintainer privately. If you do not have a[m
[32m+[m[32mprivate contact path, open a public issue asking for a security contact without[m
[32m+[m[32mincluding exploit details, crash dumps, logs, repro steps, or affected code paths.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mInclude as much of the following as you can safely share:[m
